<title>JAPAN: Sundrug -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sundrug -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.77		vs	   15.59</p>
<p> Operating	    1.25		vs	    1.13</p>
<p> Current		1.39		vs	    1.24</p>
<p> Net		  675    million	  vs	  613    million</p>
<p> EPS		   54.49 yen	  vs	   59.26 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     13 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sundrug Co Ltd operates drug stores.</p>
